A high-quality step-down power converter with an efficiency of 97.5% at 6.5V to 5V at 0.7A and relatively little heat generation. The efficiency is 94% at 12V to 5V at 1A.

Power supply 4.5V to 24V

Variable output voltage between 0.8V and 17V via potentiometer, allowing you to select very unusual voltages, quite handy!

In addition, there are a number of fixed values:
- 1.8V
- 2.5V
- 3.3V
- 5V
- 9V
- 12V

Maximum output current: 3A at 5V
Continuous output current: 2.1A

Dimensions: 20x11x5mm

Instructions for use:

This module has 4 connections:
- VO+ (Output current +)
- GND (Ground / minus)
- IN+ (Input current +)
- EN (Enable, if this is switched low no current will flow)

The ground / - of both input and output are connected to GND.

